.TH DAV\-DU "1" "February 2024" "" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
.B dav\ du
\(en Print sizes of directories/files
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dav\ du
.RB [ \-h ]
.RI [ path ]
.SH OPTIONS
.SS "POSITIONAL\ ARGUMENTS"
.TP
.I path
Show size of directories/files
.SS "OPTIONAL\ ARGUMENTS"
.TP
.B \-h\fR,\ \fB\-\-help
Show a help message and exit
.SH "SEE\ ALSO"
